    "flavor_text": {
        "sun": "Many of these Pokémon can be seen in areas with volcanic activity. Feeding can get them so excited, they exhale flames of 1,100 degrees F.",
        "moon": "A famous potter lives with a Magby. Apparently its soft flames produce fine works.",
        "ultra-sun": "When flames drip from its nose, that means it has a cold. Have it lie down for a nice rest in some magma.",
        "ultra-moon": "Its body temperature is always around 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit. If Magby falls into a small- enough pond, the whole thing will dry up."
    },
